      "text": "🟥Things I'm looking at today🟥\n\nPowered by @yeet\nSubscribe: https://t.co/7EJrnNibAt\n\n7 days of ETF outflows, Micron soars, US-Iran talks continue\n\nCrypto\n\n* BTC: 75,980 (-2%) | BTC.D: 59.9% (0%)\n* ETH: 2,085 (-2%) | BNB: 654 (-1%) | SOL: 84 (-2%)\n* Fear & Greed: 26 | 24h Liq: $337M\n* BTC ETFs: -$334M | ETH ETFs: -$35M\n* Top Gainers: RAIN, REQ, BEAT, OSMO, ALT\n* Seven consecutive outflow days for BTC ETFs\n* $1.3B of IBIT sold in a dark-pool transaction\n* All of DeFi now unsafe: Araoz\n* StakeDAO targeted for security exploit\n* $8.2m BTC sent to burn address\n* BitMine buys $237m ETH, SharpLink joins Russell\n* Spot HYPE ETFs buy 1% of market cap in 10 days\n* CME launches AVAX and SUI futures\n* CFTC to retain authority on prediction markets\n* UK sanctions HTX over Russia links\n* SoFi rolls out stablecoin\n* Binance taps BlockShoals for Philippines push\n\nMacro\n\n* NASDAQ: $26,656 (+1%) | Gold: $4,470 (-1%)\n* Futures higher as tech rally drives markets\n* Goldman raises S&P target to $8k\n* Iran-US talks continue, oil falls\n* Iran seeks part of $100B frozen assets back\n* Israel escalates Lebanon offensive\n* US scales back NATO crisis-force plan\n* Russia downed 3 Storm Shadow missiles\n* Germany, Spain reject EU plan to ban Huawei\n* 50% countries quit Czech ammo initiative\n* Europe heatwave to break records\n* US set to clear Paramount-Warner Bros deal\n\nAI & Tech\n\n* Micron soars 25%, hits $1T as UBS upgrades PT\n* SK Hynix tops $1T, joins Samsung & Micron\n* Iren jumps on $1.6B Dell AI cloud deal\n* Nvidia spending upto $150b on Taiwan AI suppliers\n* Nvidia chips likely smuggled to China by Japan\n* Claude Mythos finds proof for unit distance\n* GPT-5.5, 5.4 top Opus 4.7 on coding bench\n* Kimi-K2.6, DeepSeek-V4-Pro near Opus 4.5 ability\n* Google launches Gemini for Science tools\n* Starlink rolling out on American Airlines\n\n@YEET: Crypto's Casino   \nJust passed $2.5B in lifetime volume!      \n\ngm",
